### ==========================================
### Product Service - API Requests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8082
### ==========================================


### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health


### ==========================================
### CREATE PRODUCTS
### ==========================================

### 2. Create Product - Headphones
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-200",
  "name": "Noise Cancelling Headphones",
  "description": "Over-ear wireless headphones",
  "price": 199.99,
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "brand": "Sony"
}


### 3. Create Product - Smartphone
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-201",
  "name": "Galaxy S25",
  "description": "Premium Android smartphone with AMOLED display",
  "price": 899.99,
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "brand": "Samsung"
}


### 4. Create Product - Laptop
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-202",
  "name": "ThinkPad X1 Carbon",
  "description": "Business laptop with Intel Core processor",
  "price": 1499.99,
  "category": "COMPUTERS",
  "brand": "Lenovo"
}


