### ==========================================
### GET PRODUCT
### ==========================================

### 7. Get Product By ID
### Replace 1 with the actual product ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products/1


### ==========================================
### LIST PRODUCTS
### ==========================================

### 8. List Products - Filters + Pagination
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products?page=0&size=10&category=ELECTRONICS&status=ACTIVE&sort=price,asc


### ==========================================
### UPDATE PRODUCT
### ==========================================

### 9. Update Product
### Replace 1 with the actual product ID
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Noise Cancelling Headphones Pro",
  "description": "Improved ANC with enhanced battery life",
  "price": 249.99,
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "brand": "Sony"
}


### ==========================================
### CHANGE PRODUCT STATUS
### ==========================================

### 10. Change Product Status
### Replace 1 with the actual product ID
PATCH http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DISCONTINUED"
}


### ==========================================
### DELETE PRODUCT
### ==========================================

### 11. Soft Delete Product
### Replace 1 with the actual product ID
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products/1